Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.39,0:03:09.81,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Estive sempre sonhando
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.81,0:03:13.98,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Enquanto minhas esperanças despedaçadas atravessavam o tempo
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.98,0:03:18.36,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Em busca de diferentes tipos de gentileza
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.36,0:03:24.12,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Olho para o céu e imagino seu sorriso
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.12,0:03:30.12,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Desde aquele dia vimos o mundo de forma diferente
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.12,0:03:32.87,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Meus sentimentos transbordam
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.87,0:03:38.75,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Para colocar sua confiança em alguém não é difícil
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.75,0:03:41.80,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Então, essas memórias me dizem
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.80,0:03:47.64,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Continuar por esta estrada escondida na luz e na sombra
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.64,0:03:50.73,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Todos esses sentimentos brilham
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.73,0:03:53.39,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Eu quero te proteger
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.39,0:03:59.11,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Abrace os laços que você sentir em seu coração
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.11,0:04:02.15,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}A hora de se levantar é agora
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.15,0:04:04.91,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Deixe sua tristeza de lado
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.91,0:04:07.78,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Duas almas vão em direção à verdade
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.78,0:04:10.50,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Procurando por aquele sorriso
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.50,0:04:17.46,Owari OP2 BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur1.95}Esses sentimentos nos guiam em direção à verdade
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Signs,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.30,0:22:17.77,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)\blur5}A lua se afasta durante o amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.77,0:22:24.40,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}escondendo-se na brilhante luz forte.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.40,0:22:30.70,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Minhas emoções dão voltas infinitas,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.70,0:22:37.83,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,800)\blur5}enquanto tento conectar um coração ao outro...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.67,0:22:53.30,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)\blur5\3c&H462870&}Uma oração distante...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.30,0:22:56.89,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H462870&}Se a paz em que acreditávamos fosse uma mentira
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.89,0:23:01.52,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H51AFC3&}enganarei meu coração com tudo que tenho
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.52,0:23:06.32,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H5BBF96&}e vestirei a mim mesma com um fogo inspirador!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.32,0:23:09.74,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H5BBF96&}O jardim da criação não causa mais que destruição
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.74,0:23:14.33,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H5BBF96&}mesmo tendo uma espada de dois gumes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.33,0:23:19.14,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5\3c&H5BBF96&}continue lutando com tudo que tem...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.14,0:23:24.25,Owari ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,300)\blur5\3c&HB2B865&}Meu pequeno trapaceiro!
